    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Transport and rail boards",
     "texto": [
      "At Dutch and Belgian railway stations, information boards show the departure time («vertrek»), the expected arrival time («aankomst») and the assigned platform or track («spoor»). The indication «rechtstreeks» means the train is direct (without changes). If there are intermediate connections, the number of train changes («overstap») and the minutes of delay («vertraging») are shown."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
